WEBVTT

00:01:54.007 --> 00:01:55.040
[Robotnik]
Doctor's log.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:56.040
[Robotnik]
Doctor's log.

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:58.540
It's day 243 in this...

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:00.640
portobello purgatory.

00:02:02.019 --> 00:02:04.580
My only companion
is a rock I named Stone.

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:11.288
The question is,
for whom am I narrating this?

00:02:11.378 --> 00:02:12.939
[shudders]

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:16.990
It seems I've become
a featured player
in the theater of the absurd.

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:19.990
Marooned in deep space
by that wretched blue rodent.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:22.009
But it's all good,

00:02:22.112 --> 00:02:24.505
thanks to
a breathable atmosphere
and my supreme intellect,

00:02:24.609 --> 00:02:28.145
sharpened against
the only competitor
savvy enough to bring it.

00:02:28.829 --> 00:02:29.829
Chanterelle to d4.
Mmm.

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:34.370
I've been striving
to make fungi into
a functional drink of choice...

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:35.370
[sniffs]
Mushroom coffee.

00:02:35.469 --> 00:02:36.589
[slurps]

00:02:36.709 --> 00:02:38.149
[sputters, gags]

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:39.590
...with limited...

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:42.650
limited...

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:44.064
[gags, coughs]

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:45.150
limited...

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:47.370
success.

00:02:49.567 --> 00:02:50.738
[gasps]

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:53.870
But today, day 243,

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:56.769
has brought a new optimism
to my most pressing endeavor--

00:02:56.871 --> 00:03:01.905
planetus exodus to returnicus
and kick blue butticus.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:10.610
If my calculations
are correct,

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:12.930
and there's no reason
to say "if"
because they always are...

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:18.150
this quill is going to power
my masterpiece.

00:03:21.079 --> 00:03:22.299
Let's light this candle...

00:03:23.839 --> 00:03:25.880
and see
who comes a-knockin'.
[electricity crackling]

00:03:28.947 --> 00:03:30.393
[shrieks]

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:33.850
Greetings!
[gasps]

00:04:37.455 --> 00:04:39.516
[screaming]

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:42.058
Klaatu barada nikto.

00:04:44.119 --> 00:04:45.802
[screams]

00:04:48.412 --> 00:04:51.091
[weapons humming]

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:53.740
Agent Stone? Now!

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:01.457
[yells, grunts]

00:05:03.284 --> 00:05:05.320
[Robotnik]
Thank you, Stone.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:11.720
It's time
to say goodbye to this
piece-of-shiitake planet!

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:13.905
[grunts]

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:16.388
[panting]

00:05:21.388 --> 00:05:23.215
Huh?

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:38.660
Where did you get that?

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:45.289
From a little blue menace
on the planet called Earth.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.640
I'd be happy
to show you the way.

